msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

msgid "Notifications could not be loaded. Try again."
msgstr "無法載入通知，請重試。"

msgid "Replies to signed-in readers’ ordinary comments. Email settings are separate."
msgstr "為登入讀者的普通留言回覆提供站內通知，郵件設定獨立管理。"

msgid "Enable notifications"
msgstr "啟用站內通知"

msgid "Disabled by default. Only new comment submissions are eligible; existing comments are not backfilled. Add [pagenest_notifications] to an existing page for other themes."
msgstr "預設關閉。僅處理啟用後新提交的留言，不補發歷史通知。其他佈景主題可在現有頁面加入 [pagenest_notifications]。"

msgid "Load notifications"
msgstr "載入通知"

msgid "Enable JavaScript to load notifications."
msgstr "請啟用 JavaScript 以載入通知。"

msgid "Loading notifications…"
msgstr "正在載入通知…"

msgid "Your session expired. Sign in again."
msgstr "登入已過期，請重新登入。"

msgid "Notifications are currently unavailable."
msgstr "站內通知目前無法使用。"

msgid "Sign in to view your notifications."
msgstr "登入後查看站內通知。"

msgid "Read"
msgstr "已讀"

msgid "Unread"
msgstr "未讀"

msgid "Mark as read"
msgstr "標為已讀"

msgid "This preference does not change comment email settings."
msgstr "此偏好不影響留言郵件設定。"

msgid "Notification preference saved."
msgstr "已儲存通知偏好。"

msgid "Notification preferences"
msgstr "通知偏好"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "上一頁"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一頁"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

msgid "Refresh notifications"
msgstr "重新整理通知"

msgid "Reading and interaction"
msgstr "閱讀互動"

msgid "Search and sharing"
msgstr "搜尋與分享"

msgid "Media and folders"
msgstr "媒體與資料夾"

msgid "Social sign-in"
msgstr "社群登入"

msgid "PageNest settings"
msgstr "PageNest 設定"

msgid "All"
msgstr "全部"

msgid "Comment reply"
msgstr "留言回覆"

msgid "Mark this page as read"
msgstr "本頁標為已讀"

msgid "No recent notifications to show."
msgstr "最近沒有符合條件的通知。"

msgid "Notify article authors about new public paragraph comments"
msgstr "有新的公開段落留言時通知文章作者"

msgid "Public paragraph comment"
msgstr "公開段落留言"

msgid "Receive future comment notifications"
msgstr "接收後續留言通知"

msgid "Recent comment replies and public paragraph comments on your articles."
msgstr "最近的留言回覆，以及你文章下的公開段落留言。"

msgid "Requires notifications and paragraph comments to be enabled. Existing records are not backfilled."
msgstr "需要同時啟用通知和段落留言，不為已有紀錄補發通知。"

msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "篩選通知"

msgid "Some notifications could not be marked as read. The list has been refreshed."
msgstr "部分通知未能標為已讀，清單已重新載入。"

msgid "The latest 100 eligible notifications are shown. Filters apply within this recent window."
msgstr "僅顯示最近 100 則符合條件的通知，篩選也在此範圍內進行。"

msgid "Unread in recent notifications:"
msgstr "最近通知中未讀："

msgid "Comment replies and public paragraph comments. Email settings are separate."
msgstr "留言回覆和公開段落留言的站內通知，郵件設定獨立管理。"

#: modules/reading/account.php:161 modules/reading/account.php:170 modules/reading/account.php:172 modules/reading/account.php:178 modules/reading/bootstrap.php:208
msgid "Account reading"
msgstr "帳號閱讀"

msgid "Load this list when needed. Automatic positions and reading preferences each need separate consent."
msgstr "需要時再載入此清單。自動儲存位置與閱讀偏好均須另行同意。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:210
msgid "Load account reading"
msgstr "載入帳號閱讀"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:211
msgid "Refresh account reading"
msgstr "重新整理帳號閱讀"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:212
msgid "I agree to save public reading positions to my account"
msgstr "我同意將公開文章的閱讀位置保存到帳號"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:213
msgid "Enable account reading"
msgstr "啟用帳號閱讀"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:214
msgid "Account reading is off. Enabling it records your consent only; it does not upload device records."
msgstr "帳號閱讀尚未啟用。啟用只紀錄你的同意，不會上傳本機紀錄。"

msgid "Account reading is enabled. Merge earlier device history manually; automatic positions need separate consent."
msgstr "帳號閱讀已啟用。舊本機紀錄需手動合併，自動儲存位置須另行同意。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:216
msgid "Merge device and account records"
msgstr "合併本機與帳號紀錄"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:217
msgid "Requires device memory. Combines both lists, uses the newer reading position and keeps Read later from either list. Only the 100 most recent public articles are kept. Comments and private notes are excluded."
msgstr "需先啟用本機紀錄。合併兩端列表，同篇文章保留較新的閱讀位置，任一端的稍後讀都會保留，最多保留最近 100 篇公開文章。不包含留言和私人筆記。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:218
msgid "Manage account records"
msgstr "管理帳號紀錄"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:219
msgid "Removing account records does not delete device records. A later manual merge can add them again."
msgstr "刪除帳號紀錄不會刪除本機紀錄，之後手動合併可能再次加入。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:220
msgid "Remove from account"
msgstr "從帳號移除"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:221
msgid "Clear account records"
msgstr "清空帳號紀錄"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:222
msgid "Withdraw consent and clear account records"
msgstr "撤回同意並清空帳號紀錄"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:223
msgid "Remove this account record? Device records will remain."
msgstr "從帳號移除此筆紀錄？本機紀錄會保留。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:224
msgid "Clear all account reading records? Device records will remain."
msgstr "清空全部帳號閱讀紀錄？本機紀錄會保留。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:225
msgid "Stop account reading and clear its records? Device records will remain."
msgstr "停止帳號閱讀並清空帳號紀錄？本機紀錄會保留。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:226
msgid "Enable device memory with available browser storage before merging. You can still follow account links without downloading records to this device."
msgstr "合併前請啟用本機紀錄，並確保瀏覽器儲存可用。你仍可直接點擊帳號項目繼續閱讀，無需下載到本機。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:227
msgid "Account records changed. Refresh, review the latest list and confirm the action again."
msgstr "帳號紀錄已變化。請重新整理，查看最新列表後重新確認操作。"

#: modules/reading/account.php:10 modules/reading/bootstrap.php:228
msgid "Account reading could not be saved or loaded. Refresh and try again."
msgstr "帳號閱讀未能保存或載入，請重新整理後重試。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:229
msgid "Account records changed in another panel. Load them again before continuing."
msgstr "帳號紀錄已在另一面板變化，請重新載入後繼續。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:230
msgid "Account and device records merged. The 100 most recent public articles are kept."
msgstr "帳號與本機紀錄已合併，保留最近 100 篇公開文章。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:231
msgid "The account merge succeeded, but device records could not be updated because consent, records or browser storage changed. Review the account list before merging again."
msgstr "帳號合併已完成，但本機同意、紀錄或瀏覽器儲存已變化，未能更新本機紀錄。請查看帳號列表後再決定是否重新合併。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:232
msgid "Account reading updated. Device records were kept."
msgstr "帳號閱讀已更新，本機紀錄已保留。"

msgid "Manual merge keeps the 100 most recent public articles."
msgstr "手動合併保留最近 100 篇公開文章。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:234
msgid "Sign in again before loading account reading."
msgstr "請重新登入後載入帳號閱讀。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:235
msgid "Account reading is currently unavailable. Load again after it is enabled."
msgstr "帳號閱讀目前不可用，請在功能開啟後重新載入。"

#: modules/reading/bootstrap.php:236
msgid "Account reading consent has changed. Load again and review your choice."
msgstr "帳號閱讀同意狀態已變化，請重新載入並確認你的選擇。"

msgid "Offer account reading sync"
msgstr "提供帳號閱讀同步"

msgid "Disabled by default. Readers separately consent to manual account records, automatic current positions and reading preferences. Private comments and notes are never included."
msgstr "預設關閉。讀者分別同意手動帳號紀錄、自動儲存目前位置與閱讀偏好，不包含私人留言和筆記。"

#: modules/reading/account.php:187
msgid "Account reading could not be erased. Retry after storage is available."
msgstr "帳號閱讀未能擦除，請在儲存恢復後重試。"

msgid "Disabled by default. Device reading memory remains optional. Account reading and reading preferences each require explicit consent. Device reading sends article IDs only to check current public access."
msgstr "預設關閉。本機閱讀記憶維持可選。帳號閱讀與閱讀偏好均須讀者明確同意。本機閱讀傳送的文章 ID 僅用於檢查目前的公開存取權限。"

msgid "Optional browser storage. Earlier device history stays local unless you manually merge it. Automatic positions and reading preferences each need separate consent. Article IDs are checked before display. Position does not mean an article was read."
msgstr "可選的瀏覽器儲存。舊本機紀錄只在手動合併時加入帳號；自動儲存位置與閱讀偏好須分別同意。顯示前會檢查文章 ID，閱讀位置不代表文章已讀。"

msgid "Device history stays here. Optional account features require separate consent."
msgstr "本機紀錄儲存在這裡，可選帳號功能需分別同意。"

msgid "Account reading is paused on this site. Records are not loaded; you can still withdraw consent and clear account records."
msgstr "本站已暫停帳號閱讀。紀錄暫不載入，你仍可撤回同意並清空帳號紀錄。"

msgid "Account reading was saved, but its current list could not be loaded. Refresh before making another change."
msgstr "帳號閱讀已儲存，但未能載入目前清單。請先重新整理，再進行其他操作。"

msgid "Account records were saved, but this site paused syncing. Device records were kept."
msgstr "帳號紀錄已儲存，但本站已暫停同步，本機紀錄已保留。"

msgid "Account reading sync currently supports single-site WordPress only."
msgstr "帳號閱讀同步目前僅支援單一網站 WordPress。"

msgid "Automatic reading and reading preferences"
msgstr "自動閱讀與閱讀偏好"

msgid "Load sync settings"
msgstr "載入同步設定"

msgid "Automatically save future reading positions on this device"
msgstr "在此裝置自動儲存之後的閱讀位置"

msgid "Sync reading size, width and palette on this device"
msgstr "在此裝置同步字級、寬度與閱讀配色"

msgid "Automatic reading saves only the current public article after consent. Earlier device history still needs a manual merge. Reading preferences have separate consent; withdrawing them keeps device preferences. Stopping automatic reading keeps saved reading records. Stopping automatic reading or withdrawing preferences also pauses other devices until they confirm again."
msgstr "自動閱讀只儲存同意後的目前公開文章，舊本機紀錄仍需手動合併。閱讀偏好單獨同意，撤回後本機偏好保留；停止自動閱讀也不清空既有閱讀紀錄。 停止自動閱讀或撤回偏好也會暫停其他裝置，需重新確認。"

msgid "Enabled on this device."
msgstr "已在此裝置啟用。"

msgid "Account reading preferences cleared. Device preferences were kept."
msgstr "帳號閱讀偏好已清除，本機偏好保留。"

msgid "Automatic saving stopped. Saved account and device records were kept."
msgstr "自動儲存已停止，既有帳號與本機紀錄保留。"

msgid "Saved to your account."
msgstr "已儲存至帳號。"

msgid "Account reading preferences applied to this page. Device values were kept."
msgstr "帳號閱讀偏好已套用至本頁，本機原設定保留。"

msgid "This device is paused. Load the latest settings, then check the option to confirm again."
msgstr "此裝置已暫停。請載入最新設定，再勾選以重新確認。"

msgid "Browser storage is unavailable. Automatic syncing is paused."
msgstr "瀏覽器儲存空間無法使用，自動同步已暫停。"

msgid "Account consent was saved, but this device could not save its sync marker. Syncing on this device is paused."
msgstr "帳號已記錄同意，但本機未能儲存同步標記，此裝置同步已暫停。"

msgid "Enable device reading memory with available browser storage before automatic saving."
msgstr "自動儲存前，請啟用本機閱讀記憶並確保瀏覽器儲存可用。"

msgid "Syncing failed and is paused. Load the latest settings and confirm again."
msgstr "同步未完成，已暫停。請載入最新設定後重新確認。"

msgid "Account state changed. Syncing is paused; load settings and confirm again. Older changes will not be resent."
msgstr "帳號狀態已變更，同步已暫停。請載入設定後重新確認，不會重新傳送舊紀錄。"

msgid "Sign-in expired. Device preferences were restored; sign in and confirm syncing again."
msgstr "登入已失效，已還原本機偏好。請重新登入後再確認同步。"

msgid "Account syncing is paused on this site. You can still withdraw existing consent."
msgstr "本站已暫停帳號同步，你仍可撤回既有同意。"

msgid "The account update was saved, but this site paused syncing. Device values were kept."
msgstr "帳號更新已儲存，但本站已暫停同步，本機設定保留。"

msgid "Enable account reading above before separately allowing automatic positions."
msgstr "請先在上方啟用帳號閱讀，再單獨同意自動儲存位置。"

msgid "This theme has no compatible reading-preference interface. Nothing was applied; you can still withdraw account preferences."
msgstr "目前主題沒有相容的閱讀偏好介面，尚未套用；你仍可撤回帳號偏好。"

msgid "Withdraw consent and clear account preferences"
msgstr "撤回同意並清空帳號偏好"

msgid "Stop automatic reading"
msgstr "停止自動閱讀"

msgid "Saving reading preferences. You can withdraw after this request finishes."
msgstr "正在儲存閱讀偏好，完成後可撤回。"
